{"title": "Shapeshifter's Boon Ring", "pageid": 9384, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shapeshifter's_Boon_Ring", "categories": ["Bugs", "Rings", "Uncommon items", "Applies to Wild Shape", "Druid set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ring_B_Gold_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Ring_B_Gold_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_B_Gold_A_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/8/81/Ring_B_Gold_A_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Shapeshifter's Boon Ring image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Ring_B_Gold_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_B_Gold_A_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Ring_B_Gold_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Shapeshifter's Boon Ring</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> that grants the wearer <b>+1d4</b> on all checks made while shapeshifted or <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">disguised</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>'I'm a talented shapeshifter too. I can shapeshift a thin body into a fat body. All I need is a steady supply of mince pies and mulled wine.' - Overheard in a tavern in Daggerford\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 70 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ShapeshiftersBurgeon_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ShapeshiftersBurgeon_Ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ShapeshiftersBurgeon_Ring\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">6853e585-e9c7-4f26-918e-995342b19d1a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6853e585-e9c7-4f26-918e-995342b19d1a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:6853e585-e9c7-4f26-918e-995342b19d1a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ShapeshiftersBurgeon_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ShapeshiftersBurgeon_Ring+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ShapeshiftersBurgeon_Ring+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Shapeshifter%27s_Boon\" title=\"Shapeshifter's Boon\">Shapeshifter's Boon</a></dt><dd>While shapeshifting or disguising yourself, gain a +1d4 bonus to all <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/34px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/45px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Ability checks</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;217&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;540</span>: Carried by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/25px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/38px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/50px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strange Ox\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png/25px-Portrait_Ox.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Portrait_Ox.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\">Strange Ox</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-28&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;170</span>: Carried by the <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\">Strange Ox</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/38px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/50px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dammon's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png/25px-Portrait_Dammon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Portrait_Dammon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon's</a> blacksmith</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;39&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-149</span>: Reward for completing <a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Devilish_Ox\" title=\"Help the Devilish Ox\">Help the Devilish Ox</a> or looted from <a href=\"/wiki/Strange_Ox\" title=\"Strange Ox\">Strange Ox</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This ring is one of few pieces of equipment that works while under the effect of <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_shape\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wild shape\">wild shape</a>. Note that it works with a Circle of Stars Druid's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/25px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/38px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/50px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Starry Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp/25px-Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Starry_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Starry_Form\" title=\"Starry Form\">Starry Form</a>, but not with a Circle of Spores Druid's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/25px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/38px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/50px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Symbiotic Entity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp/25px-Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Symbiotic_Entity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity\">Symbiotic Entity</a>.</li>\n<li>Two ways among many to trade for this item are:</li></ul>\n<ol><li>Have the player character stand next to the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling_Hideout\" title=\"Tiefling Hideout\">Tiefling Hideout</a> and use a ranged attack, then immediately enter the hideout; upon climbing back up the ladder, the attacker will be able to speak with the Ox and <a href=\"/wiki/Trading_and_item_pricing\" title=\"Trading and item pricing\">trade</a> to \"...smooth things over\".</li>\n<li>Have the attacking character flee via <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">stealth</a> and / or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">invisibility</a>.</li></ol>\n<ul><li>The <b>Mark of the Shifter</b> condition is only applied during transformation and lasts until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>; it will not be applied if this ring is put on after the wearer has already shapeshifted.</li>\n<li>Shapeshifter's Boon does not take effect if the party member is shape changed via a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Seeming\" title=\"Seeming\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/20px-Seeming_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/30px-Seeming_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/40px-Seeming_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Seeming\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/20px-Seeming_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Seeming\" title=\"Seeming\">Seeming</a> spell cast by a different party member. However, the targeted party member can then gain this effect by casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adjust_Seeming\" title=\"Adjust Seeming\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/20px-Seeming_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/30px-Seeming_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/40px-Seeming_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Adjust Seeming\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp/20px-Seeming_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Seeming_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adjust_Seeming\" title=\"Adjust Seeming\">Adjust Seeming</a> themselves and picking a different appearance.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>After application of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mark_of_the_Shifter_(Condition)\" title=\"Mark of the Shifter (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mark of the Shifter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mark_of_the_Shifter_(Condition)\" title=\"Mark of the Shifter (Condition)\">Mark of the Shifter</a>, the wearer can unequip this ring for others to use without losing the condition.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195125\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3685/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51023/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13458/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1392852/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   88.097      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   88.097      1 -total\n 30.25%   26.650     12 Template:Icon_text\n 26.11%   22.999      9 Template:Icon_link\n 25.66%   22.610     30 Template:Trim\n 14.58%   12.844     13 Template:Ifempty\n 13.85%   12.199      3 Template:Uid\n 11.22%    9.887      2 Template:Cond\n 10.92%    9.622      1 Template:WeaponType\n  8.52%    7.509     11 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9384-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195125 and revision id 381729. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}